From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Include the standard declarations used by headers and queue tests

Generic declaration-only compatibility, identified by inert source inspection
of hpc/libcircle v0.3 (3d8fbfae2b95fafe71a309fcfbb7c1c993f16ad8).
size_t requires stddef.h; memset, strlen and strcmp require string.h. Preserve
every original test body, assertion, default feature and compiler diagnostic.
License: LicenseRef-LANL-BSD (the original COPYING terms).
Upstream-Status: Not submitted; no upstream write authorized.

diff --git a/libcircle/libcircle.h b/libcircle/libcircle.h
--- a/libcircle/libcircle.h
+++ b/libcircle/libcircle.h
@@ -3,0 +4 @@
+#include <stddef.h>
diff --git a/libcircle/queue.h b/libcircle/queue.h
--- a/libcircle/queue.h
+++ b/libcircle/queue.h
@@ -3,0 +4 @@
+#include <stddef.h>
diff --git a/tests/check_queue.c b/tests/check_queue.c
--- a/tests/check_queue.c
+++ b/tests/check_queue.c
@@ -2,0 +3 @@
+#include <string.h>
